The older question file and nearest-gene file in questions/ are from
Suyash Shringarpure, "Data and code for Large language models identify
causal genes in complex trait GWAS" (Zenodo, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15594712),
and are used under CC-BY-4.0. That licence is separate from this MIT licence.

The statistical model in third_party/caldera_run is CALDERA, copyright
(c) 2024 Karl Heilbron, used under the MIT licence in that folder.
